        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana OK2520U4-PLATED, 2-1/2\" x 2\" Satin Brass Olive Knuckle Hinge</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Deltana Olive Knuckle Hinge is a Paumelle hinge where the knuckles have an olive shape. It is best suited for light-weight doors such as kitchen cabinet doors or bathroom vanity doors. This solid brass hinge measures 2-1/2 inches high and 2 inches wide and plated satin brass. Founded in 1977, Deltana is the architectural hardware manufacturer with a proven record for exceptional service and quality.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<center><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-OK2520U-Specifications.jpg?v=1704354538\" width=\"550\" height=\"286\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana OK2520U Specifications\"></center>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Deltana OK2520U Lightweight Door Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Height: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Wing Width: 1/2\"</li> \r\n<li>Overall Width: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Barrel Height: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Leaf Thickness: 3/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Sold Individually</li>\r\n<Li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<Li>Finish: Plated Satin Brass</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screw: #7x3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-OK2520U-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262253\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana OK2520U Hinge Specification (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Important</b> When selecting <b>Door Hand</b> for this olive knuckle hinge: \r\n<br>\r\n1. Stand on the <b>Push Side</b> of the door, facing the door. <br>\r\n2. If the \"Olive Knuckle Hinge\" is on your \"Left\", choose \"Left Hand Door\". <br>\r\n3. If the \"Olive Knuckle Hinge\" is on your \"Right\", choose \"Right Hand Door\". <br>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-olive-kunckle-handing.gif?v=1704354537\"  width=\"411\" height=\"140\" border=\"0\"alt=\"door handing\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
